# Stocksist session continuity

At the start of a Stocksist session, read:

1. `docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md`
2. `docs/SESSION_HANDOFF.md`
3. `docs/ISSUE_REGISTER.md`

Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` when a change alters routes, services, or data flow.

Before ending a session that changed the repo, update `docs/SESSION_HANDOFF.md` and `docs/CHANGELOG.md` with SHAs, PRs, and the next approved batch.

Do not apply production migrations, Edge deploys, DNS, cron, or secret changes unless the user explicitly asks. When approved, production Supabase work runs through **Lovable Cloud** (project `zcjptaolpumhtlwhlemq`); do not default to personal Supabase accounts or `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN`.

Run `npm run integrity` after navigation, SEO, brand, or generated MCP edits.

Canonical product domain is `https://stocksist.com`. GitHub `main` is the authoritative application source. Supabase production operations are managed in Lovable Cloud.
